      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "During World War II, the U.S. Navy established Naval Air Weapons Station China Lake just east of Inyokern, turning the area into a major ordnance testing site.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        2,
        12,
