      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "The town’s name comes from its position near the border of Inyo and Kern counties, literally meaning “in the water” in the local Paiute language.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        19
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
